---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Distributor : Wholesaler : Retailer - Bamboo Flooring, Panels"
  keywords="bamboo flooring, bamboo panels, distributor, wholesaler"
  description="Distributor, wholesaler and retailer of bamboo flooring, bamboo decking, bamboo panels based in China, export worldwidely."
  bodyClass="html not-front not-logged-in one-sidebar sidebar-second page-contact"
  footerType="postscript"
>
    <section class="container mainContent">
        <form action="/search.html" method="get" class="MobileSearch">
            <input type="text" name="MobileSearchKeywords" id="MobileSearchKeywords" />
            <input type="submit" id="MobileSearch" name="MobileSearch" value="Search" class="form-submit" />
        </form>
        <div class="row-fluid">
            <div class="content span9 ">
                <div class="innerSpacer">
                    <a id="main-content"></a>
                    <h1 class="title">About Us</h1>
                    <div class="AboutUs">
                        <p>
                            Bothbest is a proud China-based company focusing on bamboo only because it is an amazing rapidly renewable resource, we manufacture largest variety and best quality of bamboo, such as bamboo flooring, bamboo decking, bamboo panels and more creative bamboo products.<br /><br />We are equipped with high-tech computerized machines and have been recognized as a professional supplier and exporter in bamboo market world widely.<br /><br />BothBest products have been approved and used in many countries and end-users feel satisfied with our quality and service-after-sale. Our strict-quality-control and exceptional products have been widely recognized. We have been involved in operating the company and production over 20 years, and have seen tremendous growth to the point of being one of the most well-known bamboo company in China.<br /><br />The main office and facilities locate in Xuancheng, which is one of biggest Bamboo Hometown in China. Bamboo forests are abundant in our area and we do the materials in revolving way, that means we cut down the bamboo trees and we plant bamboo tress. So we will have bamboo trees forever.<br /><br />BothBest is known for supplying high quality products that will last for years and are very resistant to weathering, warping and scoffing. We only use the best bamboo, hardwood, stain, machinery and processing techniques. Our reputation is well-known in Europe ( Germany, France, Italy, UK etc ), USA and Australia.<br /><br />BothBest Bamboo Flooring Co. Ltd is ISO9001:2008 and ISO14001:2004 certified.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <h1>Eco Mission</h1>
                    <p>
                        Our mission has always been to manufacture high-quality, beautiful, and healthy bamboo building products that are durable, cost-effective, ecologically sustainable, free from toxic, provide to homeowners, builders, architects, distributors with highest level of service.
                        <br /><br />
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        We only focus on bamboo production by utilizing moso bamboo at the utmost, more bamboo used, less wood cut, to protect the forest, save energy and improve sustainable development.
                        <br /><br />
                    </p>
                    <h1>Global Sales</h1>
                    <p>
                        Since 2001, Bothbest has been committed to developing and manufacturing beautiful, environmentally friendly bamboo building products which are distributed worldwide (countries are identified in red below).
                        <br /><br />
                    </p>
                    <img src="/img/skin/map1.jpg" alt="Global Sales Map" /><br /><br />
                    <p>Europe: Germany, France, Italy, Spain, Portugal, Belgium, Holland, Denmark, Norway, Sweden, Switzerland, UK, Russia, Slovakia, Poland, Austria, Kosovo, Turkey<br /><br /></p>
                    <p>North America: USA, Canada, Mexico<br /><br /></p>
                    <p>Asia: South Korea, Japan, India, Sri Lanka, Maldives, Singapore, Philippines, Brunei, Malaysia, Saudi Arabia, UAE<br /><br /></p>
                    <p>South America: Panama, Colombia, Brazil, Chile, Argentina<br /><br /></p>
                    <p>Oceania: Australia, New Zealand<br /><br /></p>
                    <p>Africa: South Africa, Nigeria, Morocco<br /><br /></p>

                    <h1 id="RequestAQuote">Request A Quote</h1>
                    <div id="block-system-main" class="block block-system">
                        <!-- 已接入 Web3Forms 免费邮件接口 -->
                        <form class="user-info-from-cookie contact-form" action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST" id="contact-site-form" accept-charset="UTF-8">
                            <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="81ff5088-e596-4b27-851b-cbaf5ab4a4f9" />
                            <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="New Product Quote Inquiry - Bothbest" />
                            <input type="hidden" name="from_name" value="Bothbest Quote Form" />
                            <div>
                                <div class="form-item form-type-textfield form-item-name">
                                    <label for="edit-name">Name <span class="form-required" title="This field is required.">*</span></label>
                                    <input type="text" id="edit-name" name="name" value="" size="60" maxlength="255" class="form-text required" required />
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-item form-type-textfield form-item-product">
                                    <label for="edit-product">Product <span class="form-required" title="This field is required.">*</span></label>
                                    <input type="text" id="edit-product" name="product" value="" size="60" maxlength="255" class="form-text required" required />
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-item form-type-textfield form-item-mail">
                                    <label for="edit-mail">E-mail <span class="form-required" title="This field is required.">*</span></label>
                                    <input type="email" id="edit-mail" name="email" value="" size="60" maxlength="255" class="form-text required" required />
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-item form-type-textfield form-item-mail">
                                    <label for="edit-tel">Tel <span class="form-required" title="This field is required.">*</span></label>
                                    <input type="text" id="edit-tel" name="tel" value="" size="60" maxlength="255" class="form-text required" required />
                                </div>
                                <div class="clearfix"></div>
                                <div class="form-item form-type-textarea form-item-message">
                                    <label for="edit-message">Message <span class="form-required" title="This field is required.">*</span></label>
                                    <div class="form-textarea-wrapper resizable">
                                        <textarea id="edit-message" name="message" cols="60" rows="10" class="form-textarea required" required></textarea>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-actions form-wrapper" id="edit-actions">
                                    <input class="btn btn-success form-submit" type="submit" id="edit-submit" value="Send" />
                                </div>
                                <p id="quote-form-msg" style="display:none; font-weight:bold; margin-top:10px;"></p>
                            </div>
                        </form>
                    </div>

                    <div id="block-views-mentor-slider-block-1" class="block block-views AboutSlider">
                        <h1>Factory Tour</h1>
                        <div class="view view-mentor-slider view-id-mentor_slider view-display-id-block_1 slideWrap view-dom-id-2da00b99d51c37f5731cd96a81bc1428">
                            <div class="view-content">
                                <div>
                                    <div class="peVolo">
                                        <div data-delay="3"><img src="/img/UploadFiles/null-p192tir36vdbs11u31jl01r0l1d101.jpg" title="bamboo flooring factory" alt="bamboo flooring factory" /></div>
                                        <div data-delay="3"><img src="/img/UploadFiles/null-p192tiqdfpf798vp1nf6f761vfq1.jpg" title="bamboo flooring factory" alt="bamboo flooring factory" /></div>
                                        <div data-delay="3"><img src="/img/UploadFiles/null-p192tiq0goh2sgu01tnmqfbncp1.jpg" title="bamboo flooring factory" alt="bamboo flooring factory" /></div>
                                        <div data-delay="3"><img src="/img/UploadFiles/null-p192tipk50m2pkskdm0m41kkd1.jpg" title="bamboo flooring factory" alt="bamboo flooring factory" /></div>
                                        <div data-delay="3"><img src="/img/UploadFiles/null-p192tipa6imh112681v7rh4t11qm1.jpg" title="bamboo flooring factory" alt="bamboo flooring factory" /></div>
                                        <div data-delay="3"><img src="/img/UploadFiles/null-p192tiokaie4b1umk1oif136v11sj1.jpg" title="bamboo flooring factory" alt="bamboo flooring factory" /></div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <h1 class="title" id="page-title">Location</h1>
                    <div class="innerSpacer MapPanel">
                        <div class="row-fluid gmapWrap">
                            <img src="/img/UploadFiles/" alt="map" />
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="sidebar-second span3 ">
                <div id="block-block-5" class="block block-block widget_contact">
                    <section>
                        <img src="/img/skin/li_phone.png" alt="" /><h3>Phone</h3>
                        <div class="phone"><p>+86 150 0582 0528</p></div>
                    </section>
                    <section>
                        <img src="/img/skin/fax.png" alt="" /><h3>Fax</h3>
                        <div class="email"><p>15005820528</p></div>
                    </section>
                    <section>
                        <img src="/img/skin/li_skype.png" alt="" /><h3>Skype</h3>
                        <div class="email"><p>bambooflooring</p></div>
                    </section>
                    <section>
                        <img src="/img/skin/li_adr.png" alt="" /><h3>Address</h3>
                        <div class="address"><p>Tangpu Industrial Zone, Anji</p></div>
                    </section>
                    <section>
                        <img src="/img/skin/li_let.png" alt="" /><h3>Email</h3>
                        <div class="email"><p><a href="mailto:info@bambooflooringchina.com">info@bambooflooringchina.com</a></p></div>
                    </section>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <script is:inline type="text/javascript">
        if (document.getElementById("edit-product") && document.referrer) {
            document.getElementById("edit-product").value = document.referrer;
        }
        var quoteForm = document.getElementById("contact-site-form");
        var quoteMsg = document.getElementById("quote-form-msg");
        if (quoteForm) {
            quoteForm.addEventListener("submit", function (e) {
                e.preventDefault();
                var submitBtn = document.getElementById("edit-submit");
                if (submitBtn) submitBtn.value = "Sending...";
                var formData = new FormData(quoteForm);
                fetch("https://api.web3forms.com/submit", {
                    method: "POST",
                    body: formData
                })
                .then(function (res) { return res.json(); })
                .then(function (data) {
                    if (submitBtn) submitBtn.value = "Send";
                    if (data.success) {
                        quoteMsg.style.display = "block";
                        quoteMsg.style.color = "#468847";
                        quoteMsg.textContent = "Thank you! Your inquiry has been sent successfully. We will contact you soon.";
                        quoteForm.reset();
                    } else {
                        alert("Failed to send inquiry: " + (data.message || "Please check your access_key."));
                    }
                })
                .catch(function () {
                    if (submitBtn) submitBtn.value = "Send";
                    alert("Network error, please try again later.");
                });
            });
        }
    </script>
</BaseLayout>